# Testing

## Backend (pytest)

- Location: `backend/tests/unit/` only
- Service-layer tests with mocks; no new `tests/api/` or `tests/service/`
- Env: `TEST_DATABASE_URL` for integration-style fixtures
- Run: `pipenv run pytest tests/unit/` (from `backend/`)

## Frontend (Vitest + Testing Library)

- Colocate: `*.test.ts(x)` next to source
- Run: `npm test` (from `frontend/`)

## When to write tests

- ✅ New services/hooks, validation, bug fixes (regression)
- ❌ Styling-only changes

`backend/scripts/seed_test_data.py` is a no-op stub — unit tests use mocks, not KP seed patterns.
